<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss 3-month money market claims yield 1.33 pct.</title>
<headline>Swiss 3-month money market claims yield 1.33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annual yield on the latest issue of Swiss federal government three-month money market claims is 1.331 percent, down from the previous issue's 1.457 percent, the Swiss National Bank said.</p>
<p>The latest issue, to be paid for on October 3, raised 925.40 million Swiss francs and was priced at 99.661 percent.</p>
<p>The previous issue, paid for on September 26, raised 1,011.05 million and was priced at 1.457 percent.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
